      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would posit then that this is a bug in the PPM implementation and sending CCI via notify is not the correct thing to do.\n\nIf we are seeing races because CCI is being updated AFTER a notify is sent but before the OPM has read it, that is definitely a PPM bug and we need to fix it.",
